# The grading run writes a sqlite mirror of the cost ledger beside every grade
# file. The published record is the .jsonl next to it; the database is a local
# working copy, tens of megabytes of it. The workflow only ever stages the two
# files it names, but a hand-published result is staged by hand -- as in #322 --
# so the by-product is named here rather than left to whoever is typing.
data/grades/**/*.cost_ledger.sqlite3

*.parquet
